<title>USA: Leasing Solutions acquires portfolio.</title>
<headline>Leasing Solutions acquires portfolio.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif. 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leasing Solutions Inc said Friday that it has purchased a Canadian portfolio of information processing and communications equipment and the related leases from Scott Capital Group Inc.</p>
<p>The original equipment purchase price of the portfolio is about C$80 million, the company said.</p>
</text>
